(17,1,'2026-06-21 22:01:27','2026-06-21 22:01:27','<p>A Platform for Dharma-Driven Change</p>\n<h2>ShivBodh Trust</h2>\n<p>Sampreshan empowers individuals and organizations to raise awareness, gather support, and create positive change for causes related to Sanatana Dharma.</p>\n<p>Our mission is to connect communities, amplify important voices, and provide a trusted platform where meaningful petitions and campaigns can inspire collective action.</p>\n<p>From temple preservation and cultural heritage to social and religious initiatives, Sampreshan helps people come together around the issues that matter most.</p>\n<p>Every signature strengthens a cause. Every voice contributes to change.</p>\n<p>													<img width=\"750\" height=\"750\" src=\"https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/sampreshn-logo-with-flag.png\" alt=\"new modern logo\" srcset=\"https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/sampreshn-logo-with-flag.png 750w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/sampreshn-logo-with-flag-300x300.png 300w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/sampreshn-logo-with-flag-150x150.png 150w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/sampreshn-logo-with-flag-624x624.png 624w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" /></p>\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-06-24 17:08:37','2026-06-24 17:08:37','',0,'https://sampreshan.tech/?page_id=17',0,'page','',0),
