       </p>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works from our content without prior written permission.</li>\n                        <li>You retain ownership of the content you submit, but you grant us a non-exclusive license to display, store, and share it on the platform.</li>\n                        <li>Any unauthorized use of our intellectual property may result in legal action.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p>\n                        We respect the intellectual property rights of others and expect our users\n                        to do the same. If you believe that your intellectual property has been\n                        infringed, please contact us with the relevant details.\n                    </p>\n                <!-- ===== 10. Content Moderation ===== -->\n                    <h2>10. Content Moderation</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        Sampreshan is committed to maintaining a safe, respectful, and constructive\n                        environment. To achieve this, we reserve the right to:\n                    </p>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>Review all content submitted to the platform.</li>\n                        <li>Edit or remove any content that violates these terms or our community standards.</li>\n                        <li>Suspend or terminate user accounts that engage in prohibited activities.</li>\n                        <li>Take appropriate legal action when necessary.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p>\n                        We strive to be fair and transparent in our moderation practices. If you\n                        have questions or concerns about a moderation decision, please contact us.\n                    </p>\n                <!-- ===== 11. Third-Party Links ===== -->\n                    <h2>11. Third-Party Links</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        The Sampreshan platform may contain links to third-party websites or services\n                        that are not owned or controlled by us. We provide these links for your\n                        convenience and do not endorse or assume any responsibility for the content,\n                        privacy policies, or practices of these third-party sites.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        You acknowledge and agree that Sampreshan shall not be liable for any damages\n                        or losses arising from your use of any third-party websites or services.\n                        We encourage you to review the terms and policies of any third-party site\n                        you visit.\n                    </p>\n                <!-- ===== 12. Disclaimer of Warranties ===== -->\n                    <h2>12. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        The Sampreshan platform is provided on an \"as is\" and \"as available\" basis,\n                        without any warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. We make no\n                        representations or warranties regarding the accuracy, reliability, or\n                        availability of the platform.\n                    </p>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>We do not warrant that the platform will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free from viruses or other harmful components.</li>\n                        <li>We do not endorse or guarantee the accuracy of any content submitted by users.</li>\n                        <li>Your use of the platform is at your own risk.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p>\n                        To the fullest extent permitted by law, we disclaim all warranties, including\n                        but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a\n                        particular purpose, and non-infringement.\n                    </p>\n                <!-- ===== 13. Limitation of Liability ===== -->\n                    <h2>13. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Sampreshan and its\n                        affiliates, officers, directors, employees, and agents shall not be liable\n                        for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive\n                        damages arising out of or in connection with your use of the platform.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        This limitation applies to any claims, losses, or damages, whether based on\n                        contract, tort, negligence, strict liability, or otherwise, even if we have\n                        been advised of the possibility of such damages.\n                    </p>\n                        ⏳ Placeholder\n                            ⚖️\n                            Applicable Legal Limitations\n                            Specific legal limitations on liability, including any jurisdictional caps or exclusions, will be added here once established.\n                <!-- ===== 14. Termination of Access ===== -->\n                    <h2>14. Termination of Access</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to the Sampreshan\n                        platform at any time, with or without cause, and with or without notice.\n                        Grounds for termination may include, but are not limited to:\n                    </p>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>Violation of these Terms of Use or our community standards.</li>\n                        <li>Engaging in prohibited activities or illegal conduct.</li>\n                        <li>Providing false or misleading information.</li>\n                        <li>Any other conduct that we deem harmful to the platform or its users.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <p>\n                        Upon termination, your right to use the platform will cease immediately.\n                        We may, at our discretion, delete or retain your content in accordance with\n                        our data retention policies.\n                    </p>\n                <!-- ===== 15. Governing Law ===== -->\n                    <h2>15. Governing Law</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        These Terms of Use shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the\n                        applicable laws of the jurisdiction in which Sampreshan operates.\n                    </p>\n                        ⏳ Placeholder\n                            📜\n                            Governing Law\n                            The specific governing law that applies to these terms will be added here once determined.\n                        ⏳ Placeholder\n                            📍\n                            Jurisdiction\n                            The jurisdiction for any legal disputes or proceedings will be added here once established.\n                <!-- ===== 16. Contact Information ===== -->\n                    <h2>16. Contact Information</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding these Terms of Use\n                        or the Sampreshan platform, please reach out to us:\n                    </p>\n                    <p style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n                        <strong>Email:</strong>\n                        <a href=\"mailto:sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\" style=\"color:var(--deep-blue);font-weight:600;\">\n                            sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\n                        </a>\n                    </p>\n                        ⏳ Placeholder\n                            🏢\n                            Registered Office Address\n                            The registered office address of Sampreshan will be added here once available.\n                        ⏳ Placeholder\n                            👤\n                            Legal Contact Person\n                            The name and designation of the person responsible for legal matters will be added here.\n                <!-- ===== 17. Changes to Terms ===== -->\n                    <h2>17. Changes to These Terms</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        Sampreshan reserves the right to update or modify these Terms of Use at any\n                        time. We will post any changes on this page, and we encourage you to review\n                        these terms periodically.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        If we make material changes to these terms, we will notify you through\n                        appropriate channels, such as email or a prominent notice on our website.\n                        Your continued use of the platform after any such changes constitutes your\n                        acceptance of the updated terms.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        The date of the latest revision will always be displayed at the top of this page.\n                    </p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== Contact Section ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"contact-heading\" id=\"contact-section\">\n                    <h2 id=\"contact-heading\">Contact Sampreshan</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        Have a question about these Terms of Use or need clarification? Reach out to us —\n                        we are here to help.\n                    </p>\n                    <a href=\"mailto:sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\" aria-label=\"Send an email to Sampreshan\">\n                        ✉️ sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\n                    </a>\n                            ⏳ Placeholder\n                                🏢\n                                Registered Office Address\n                            Registered office address\n                            ⏳ Placeholder\n                                👤\n                                Legal Contact Person\n                            Legal &amp; compliance contact\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <!-- ===== Footer ===== -->\n    <footer role=\"contentinfo\" aria-label=\"Site footer\">\n                Sampreshan.\n                Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"/about.html\">About</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/privacy-policy.html\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/terms-of-use.html\" aria-current=\"page\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"mailto:sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\">Contact</a></li>\n            </ul>\n                &copy;  Sampreshan. All rights reserved.\n    </footer>\n    <!-- ===== JavaScript ===== -->\n</body>\n</html>','Terms &amp; Conditions','','inherit','closed','closed','','78-revision-v1','','','2026-06-24 16:52:13','2026-06-24 16:52:13','',78,'https://sampreshan.tech/?p=83',0,'revision','',0),
(84,1,'2026-06-24 16:54:33','2026-06-24 16:54:33','<h2 data-interaction-id=\"1e09856\">Community Guidelines</h2>\n					<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>Community Guidelines — Sampreshan | Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Community Guidelines for Sampreshan — building a respectful, constructive, and Dharma-centric community together. Learn about our values, expected behavior, and moderation policies.\" />\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://sampreshan.org/community-guidelines.html\" />\n    <!-- Open Graph -->\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Community Guidelines — Sampreshan\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Community Guidelines for Sampreshan — building a respectful, constructive, and Dharma-centric community together.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://sampreshan.org/community-guidelines.html\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Sampreshan\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_IN\" />\n    <!-- Twitter Card -->\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Community Guidelines — Sampreshan\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Community Guidelines for Sampreshan — building a respectful, constructive, and Dharma-centric community together.\" />\n    <!-- JSON-LD Schema Markup -->\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"community-guidelines.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- ===== Skip Link ===== -->\n    <a href=\"#main-content\">Skip to main content</a>\n    <!-- ===== Header ===== -->\n    <header role=\"banner\" aria-label=\"Site header\">\n            <a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Sampreshan — Home\">\n                सं\n                Sampreshan.\n                    Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam\n            </a>\n            <button id=\"navToggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"navLinks\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation menu\">\n            </button>\n            <ul id=\"navLinks\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n                <li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/about.html\">About</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/petitions.html\">Petitions</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/community-guidelines.html\" aria-current=\"page\">Community</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/contact.html\">Contact</a></li>\n            </ul>\n    </header>\n    <!-- ===== Main ===== -->\n    <main id=\"main-content\">\n        <!-- ===== Hero ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"hero-heading\">\n                        🖼️\n                Community Standards\n                <h1 id=\"hero-heading\">Community Guidelines</h1>\n                <p>\n                    Building a respectful, constructive, and Dharma-centric community together.\n                    These guidelines help us create a safe and meaningful space for all.\n                </p>\n                    <a href=\"#values\">Join Community</a>\n                    <a href=\"#discussions\">Explore Discussions</a>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== Table of Contents ===== -->\n        <nav aria-label=\"Table of contents\">\n                    📑 On this page:\n                    <a href=\"#values\">Values</a>\n                    <a href=\"#expected-behavior\">Expected Behavior</a>\n                    <a href=\"#encouraged\">Encouraged</a>\n                    <a href=\"#prohibited\">Prohibited</a>\n                    <a href=\"#petitions\">Petitions</a>\n                    <a href=\"#discussions\">Discussions</a>\n                    <a href=\"#moderation\">Moderation</a>\n                    <a href=\"#reporting\">Reporting</a>\n                    <a href=\"#consequences\">Consequences</a>\n                    <a href=\"#commitment\">Commitment</a>\n                    <a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a>\n        </nav>\n        <!-- ===== 1. Our Community Values ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"values-heading\" id=\"values\">\n                    Core Values\n                    <h2 id=\"values-heading\">Our Community Values</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        These values are the foundation of our community. They guide every interaction,\n                        discussion, and initiative on Sampreshan.\n                    </p>\n                        🙏\n                        <h3>Respect</h3>\n                        <p>Every member is treated with dignity and honor, regardless of background or perspective.</p>\n                        🔍\n                        <h3>Truthfulness</h3>\n                        <p>We value honesty and authenticity in all communications and submissions.</p>\n                        🤲\n                        <h3>Responsibility</h3>\n                        <p>Each member takes ownership of their words and actions within the community.</p>\n                        💬\n                        <h3>Constructive Dialogue</h3>\n                        <p>We engage in conversations that build understanding and lead to positive outcomes.</p>\n                        👥\n                        <h3>Community Participation</h3>\n                        <p>Active and thoughtful participation strengthens our collective voice and impact.</p>\n                        🕉️\n                        <h3>Dharma-Centric Engagement</h3>\n                        <p>All activities are rooted in the eternal principles of Sanatana Dharma.</p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 2. Expected Behavior ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"behavior-heading\" id=\"expected-behavior\">\n                    Community Standards\n                    <h2 id=\"behavior-heading\">Expected Behavior</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        We hold ourselves to high standards of conduct. These expectations ensure\n                        a positive experience for everyone in our community.\n                    </p>\n                        🤝\n                        <h3>Remain Respectful</h3>\n                        <p>Treat every community member with courtesy, kindness, and respect at all times.</p>\n                        💡\n                        <h3>Discuss Ideas, Not Individuals</h3>\n                        <p>Focus on the substance of ideas and proposals, not on personal characteristics.</p>\n                        📋\n                        <h3>Share Accurate Information</h3>\n                        <p>Ensure that all information shared is truthful, verified, and reliable.</p>\n                        🌟\n                        <h3>Participate Constructively</h3>\n                        <p>Contribute in ways that add value and support the community\'s mission.</p>\n                        🌍\n                        <h3>Respect Differing Viewpoints</h3>\n                        <p>Recognize that diversity of thought enriches our community and approach disagreements with grace.</p>\n                        ☮️\n                        <h3>Promote Peaceful Engagement</h3>\n                        <p>Advocate for change and dialogue through peaceful, lawful, and constructive means.</p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 3. What Is Encouraged ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"encouraged-heading\" id=\"encouraged\">\n                    Positive Engagement\n                    <h2 id=\"encouraged-heading\">What Is Encouraged</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        We welcome and celebrate these types of contributions and initiatives\n                        that align with our Dharma-centric mission.\n                    </p>\n                        🛕\n                        Temple preservation discussions\n                        🏛️\n                        Cultural heritage awareness\n                        📖\n                        Religious education initiatives\n                        🤝\n                        Community welfare proposals\n                        📢\n                        Dharma awareness campaigns\n                        💬\n                        Constructive feedback\n                        🧑‍🤝‍🧑\n                        Volunteer coordination\n                        🏛️\n                        Collaboration with institutions\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 4. Prohibited Content ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"prohibited-heading\" id=\"prohibited\">\n                    Restricted\n                    <h2 id=\"prohibited-heading\">Prohibited Content</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        The following types of content and behavior are strictly prohibited on Sampreshan.\n                        Violations may result in immediate action.\n                    </p>\n                        🚫\n                        Hate speech\n                        🚫\n                        Religious insults\n                        🚫\n                        Harassment\n                        🚫\n                        Personal attacks\n                        🚫\n                        Threats\n                        🚫\n                        Defamation\n                        🚫\n                        Misinformation\n                        🚫\n                        Spam\n                        🚫\n                        Impersonation\n                        🚫\n                        Illegal content\n                        🚫\n                        Copyright violations\n                        🚫\n                        Malware distribution\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 5. Petition Guidelines ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"petitions-heading\" id=\"petitions\">\n                    Petition Standards\n                    <h2 id=\"petitions-heading\">Petition Guidelines</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        Petitions are a powerful way to raise awareness and gather support.\n                        These guidelines ensure they serve the community with integrity.\n                    </p>\n                        ✅\n                            <h4>Relate to Sanatana Dharma</h4>\n                            <p>Petitions must address Dharma-related concerns, cultural heritage, or community welfare.</p>\n                        ✅\n                            <h4>Be Fact-Based</h4>\n                            <p>All information in petitions must be accurate, truthful, and verifiable.</p>\n                        ✅\n                            <h4>Remain Respectful</h4>\n                            <p>Petitions should be phrased with dignity and respect for all parties involved.</p>\n                        ✅\n                            <h4>Avoid Inflammatory Language</h4>\n                            <p>Refrain from using provocative, divisive, or inflammatory language.</p>\n                        ✅\n                            <h4>Avoid Targeting Individuals</h4>\n                            <p>Focus on issues and systems, not on personal attacks against individuals.</p>\n                        ✅\n                            <h4>Encourage Constructive Solutions</h4>\n                            <p>Petitions should propose positive, actionable pathways forward.</p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 6. Discussion Guidelines ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"discussions-heading\" id=\"discussions\">\n                    Dialogue Principles\n                    <h2 id=\"discussions-heading\">Discussion Guidelines</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        Meaningful discussions are the heart of our community. These principles\n                        guide how we engage with one another.\n                    </p>\n                        🧠\n                        <h3>Evidence-Based Conversation</h3>\n                        <p>Support your views with facts, sources, and reasoned arguments.</p>\n                        🤝\n                        <h3>Respectful Disagreement</h3>\n                        <p>It is possible to disagree without being disagreeable. Debate ideas, not people.</p>\n                        💡\n                        <h3>Thoughtful Participation</h3>\n                        <p>Take time to understand the topic before contributing. Quality over quantity.</p>\n                        🌟\n                        <h3>Positive Contribution</h3>\n                        <p>Add value to the conversation. Help build understanding and community.</p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 7. Content Moderation Policy ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"moderation-heading\" id=\"moderation\">\n                    Moderation\n                    <h2 id=\"moderation-heading\">Content Moderation</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        To maintain a safe and respectful environment, Sampreshan reserves the right\n                        to review, moderate, and take action on all content submitted to the platform.\n                    </p>\n                        1\n                            <h4>Review Content</h4>\n                            <p>All submissions are reviewed for compliance with community guidelines.</p>\n                        2\n                            <h4>Remove Violations</h4>\n                            <p>Content that violates guidelines is removed promptly.</p>\n                        3\n                            <h4>Restrict Access</h4>\n                            <p>Users who violate guidelines may have their access restricted.</p>\n                        4\n                            <h4>Suspend Accounts</h4>\n                            <p>Serious or repeated violations lead to account suspension.</p>\n                        5\n                            <h4>Permanent Ban</h4>\n                            <p>Repeat offenders or severe violations result in a permanent ban.</p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 8. Reporting Violations ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"reporting-heading\" id=\"reporting\">\n                    Report\n                    <h2 id=\"reporting-heading\">Reporting Violations</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        If you encounter content or behavior that violates our community guidelines,\n                        please report it. Your vigilance helps keep our community safe.\n                    </p>\n                        📧\n                            <h3>Report a Concern</h3>\n                            <p>Email us directly with details of the violation. All reports are confidential and handled with care.</p>\n                            <a href=\"mailto:sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\">\n                                📨 Report Content\n                            </a>\n                            <p>sampreshan.tech@gmail.com</p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 9. Consequences of Violations ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"consequences-heading\" id=\"consequences\">\n                    Enforcement\n                    <h2 id=\"consequences-heading\">Consequences of Violations</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        We apply a progressive enforcement approach to ensure fairness while\n                        maintaining community standards.\n                    </p>\n                        Level 1\n                        ⚠️\n                        <h4>Warning</h4>\n                        <p>Notification of violation with guidance on corrective action.</p>\n                        Level 2\n                        🗑️\n                        <h4>Content Removal</h4>\n                        <p>Violating content is removed from the platform.</p>\n                        Level 3\n                        🔒\n                        <h4>Temporary Restriction</h4>\n                        <p>Access to certain features is temporarily limited.</p>\n                        Level 4\n                        ⛔\n                        <h4>Account Suspension</h4>\n                        <p>Account is suspended for a defined period.</p>\n                        Level 5\n                        🚫\n                        <h4>Permanent Ban</h4>\n                        <p>Account is permanently banned from the platform.</p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 10. Community Commitment ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"commitment-heading\" id=\"commitment\">\n                    🕉️\n                    <blockquote>\n                        \"Sampreshan seeks to promote respectful dialogue, lawful participation,\n                        and constructive community engagement for the preservation, protection,\n                        and promotion of Sanatana Dharma.\"\n                    </blockquote>\n                    <p>— Community Commitment</p>\n        </section>\n        <!-- ===== 11. Contact Section ===== -->\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"contact-heading\" id=\"contact\">\n                    <h2 id=\"contact-heading\">Contact Sampreshan</h2>\n                    <p>\n                        Have questions about our Community Guidelines or need to report a concern?\n                        Reach out to us — we are here to help.\n                    </p>\n                    <a href=\"mailto:sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\" aria-label=\"Send an email to Sampreshan\">\n                        ✉️ sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\n                    </a>\n                            ⏳ Placeholder\n                                👤\n                                Community Manager\n                            Primary community contact\n                            ⏳ Placeholder\n                                📋\n                                Escalation Contact\n                            For escalated concerns and appeals\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <!-- ===== Footer ===== -->\n    <footer role=\"contentinfo\" aria-label=\"Site footer\">\n                Sampreshan.\n                Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"/about.html\">About</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/community-guidelines.html\" aria-current=\"page\">Community Guidelines</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/privacy-policy.html\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"mailto:sampreshan.tech@gmail.com\">Contact</a></li>\n            </ul>\n                &copy;  Sampreshan. All rights reserved.\n    </footer>\n    <!-- ===== JavaScript ===== -->\n</body>\n</html>','Community Guidelines','','publish','closed','closed','','community-guidelines','','','2026-06-24 16:56:51','2026-06-24 16:56:51','',0,'https://sampreshan.tech/?page_id=84',0,'page','',0),
